      "rationale": "The ledger (L1\u2013L4, PMC10316194) names the exact junction Y1015\u2013A1016 in the large extracellular loop (topology span 948\u20131017). Python confirms seq[1014]='Y' and seq[1015]='A', matching the paper exactly. The insert point is 68 residues from the upstream TM boundary (947) and 2 residues from the downstream TM boundary (1018); the proximity to the downstream TM is noted, but the paper directly validates surface exposure and preserved electrophysiology at this exact junction, overriding the heuristic. cited_tag_residue=1015 because the paper names residue 1015 as the last residue before the insertion. Full-length TRPM4 with HA (YPYDVPDYA) inserted between Y1015 and A1016 by site-directed mutagenesis, expressed in HEK293 cells. Surface exposure of the tag was confirmed by antibody binding in intact (non-permeabilized) cells. Membrane fractionation confirmed predominant membrane-fraction expression comparable to wild-type.",
